      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T16:18:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "See later comment. For this, you could use `stclr` instead of the cmpxchg loop, however the ordering here is even more subtle.\n\nAcquire isn\u0027t what you want, as that only applies to the load part of the cmpxchg, so the later va_{start,end} updates can be hoisted above the store to the bitmap. Instead, I think you need _release_ semantics (i.e. `stclrl`) to make sure that the bitmap isn\u0027t updated until after the page-table has been updated.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1303,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 1307,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "b4815880716fa69e1b6f39ece179ca6fc6f2575e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
