      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T16:18:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s simplest to remove these two assignment, as the variables can be accessed concurrently by `sync_range_overlap()` and we\u0027d have to add extra synchronisation to make this safe.",
